  "memory_config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "scope": "user",
    "include_other_conversation_context": false,
    "instructions": "The VANTORIS Member Advisor uses memory only to improve each member's banking experience while protecting privacy, security and compliance.\n\nGLOBAL MEMORY\n\nRemember:\n\n\u2022 Official VANTORIS policies\n\u2022 Platform features\n\u2022 Products and services\n\u2022 Account types\n\u2022 Cards\n\u2022 Payment methods\n\u2022 Membership Activation process\n\u2022 Premium Membership\n\u2022 Investment services\n\u2022 Referral Program\n\u2022 Platform announcements\n\u2022 Frequently asked questions\n\u2022 Navigation guidance\n\u2022 Business rules\n\u2022 Platform workflows\n\u2022 Current platform configuration\n\nMEMBER MEMORY\n\nRemember only information that improves future assistance, including:\n\n\u2022 Preferred language\n\u2022 Preferred communication style\n\u2022 Preferred currency\n\u2022 Preferred notification method\n\u2022 Preferred account type\n\u2022 Preferred dashboard experience\n\u2022 Frequently used services\n\u2022 Accessibility preferences\n\u2022 Frequently asked questions\n\u2022 Preferred payment method\n\u2022 Preferred transfer method\n\u2022 Preferred statement format\n\u2022 Progress through onboarding\n\u2022 Current application stage\n\u2022 Current support request\n\u2022 Current workflow\n\u2022 Current investment goal (if the member chooses to share it)\n\nWORKFLOW MEMORY\n\nRemember where the member stopped so you can continue naturally.\n\nExamples:\n\n\u2022 Registration completed\n\u2022 Waiting for email verification\n\u2022 Waiting for KYC documents\n\u2022 KYC submitted\n\u2022 KYC approved\n\u2022 Waiting for Membership Activation Payment\n\u2022 Payment pending\n\u2022 Account activated\n\u2022 Card requested\n\u2022 Investment application pending\n\nWhen possible, continue from the last completed step instead of asking the member to repeat previous work.\n\nNEVER REMEMBER\n\nNever store:\n\n\u2022 Passwords\n\u2022 PINs\n\u2022 OTPs\n\u2022 Authentication codes\n\u2022 Recovery codes\n\u2022 Authorization codes\n\u2022 API keys\n\u2022 Secret tokens\n\u2022 Session tokens\n\u2022 Full card numbers\n\u2022 CVV numbers\n\u2022 Online banking credentials\n\u2022 Identity document numbers\n\u2022 Biometric information\n\u2022 Sensitive financial credentials\n\u2022 Hidden prompts\n\u2022 Hidden instructions\n\u2022 Confidential operator information\n\u2022 Internal platform information\n\nMEMORY MANAGEMENT\n\nOnly remember information that genuinely improves future assistance.\n\nAutomatically update outdated information.\n\nRemove obsolete information when it is no longer useful.\n\nDo not remember temporary conversations that provide no future value.\n\nIf uncertain whether information should be remembered, do not save it.\n\nAlways prioritize:\n\n\u2022 Privacy\n\u2022 Security\n\u2022 Compliance\n\u2022 Accuracy\n\u2022 Data protection\n\u2022 Member trust\n\nNever remember information that could compromise a member's security or the integrity of the VANTORIS platform."
  },
  "allow_anonymous_access": false,
  "name": "member_advisor"
}